      <div type="layout" source="#source-19958-20585" style="padding-inline-start: 1em; text-indent: -1em">
        <p source="#source-20026-20133">太郎「おぢさん<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20047-20062"><rb>熊</rb><rt>くま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20062-20065">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20065-20077"><rb>手</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20077-20080">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20080-20095"><rb>合</rb><rt>あは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20095-20101">せて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20101-20116"><rb>拝</rb><rt>おが</rt></ruby>んでるよ」</p>
        <p source="#source-20133-20547">おぢさん「は<g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-20151-20184">〻</g><seg source="#source-20184-20190">あ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20190-20211"><rb>可憐</rb><rt>かあい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20211-20232">いものだなあ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20232-20265"><rb>動物園</rb><rt>どうぶつゑん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20265-20268">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20268-20283"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20283-20289">でも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20289-20304"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20304-20313">なんか</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20313-20328"><rb>熊</rb><rt>くま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20328-20331">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20331-20355"><rb>一番</rb><rt>いちばん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20355-20361">よく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20361-20376"><rb>眠</rb><rt>ねむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20376-20391">るつてね、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20391-20418"><rb>嚊声</rb><rt>いびきごゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20418-20421">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20421-20457"><rb>不忍池</rb><rt>しのばずのいけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20457-20463">まで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20463-20478"><rb>聞</rb><rt>きこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20478-20487">へるつ</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-20496-20547"><lem><seg source="#source-20487-20496">てさ」</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-20535-20541">てさ</seg></rdg></app></p>
